<StudioLayout title="NarriaFlow \u2014 Write Your World" description="NarriaFlow is an infinite-canvas writing web app for visual thinkers. Connect chapters and characters, develop your story with AI assistance, and export your manuscript.">
<section class="container narria-hero"><div class="narria-hero-copy"><a class="text-link" href="/products/">← All tools</a><p class="eyebrow">NARRIAFLOW / VISUAL WRITING</p><h1>Write<br>Your <em>World.</em></h1><p class="lede">A writing workspace for authors who think visually. Find room for every chapter, character, and connection on an infinite canvas.</p><div class="narria-intro-actions"><a class="button" href="#writing-workspace">Explore the workspace <span>↓</span></a><span class="status launch">Complete · Awaiting launch</span></div></div><div class="narria-hero-art"><div class="narria-canvas" aria-hidden="true"><div class="narria-canvas-top"><strong>NarriaFlow</strong><span>A WORLD TAKING SHAPE</span></div><svg class="story-connections" viewBox="0 0 500 300" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M110 100 C230 100 160 170 260 170 S350 70 415 70 M260 170 C310 170 330 250 420 240"/></svg><div class="story-note story-person"><span>CHARACTER</span><strong>The cartographer</strong><p>She remembers places<br>that no longer exist.</p><i>Connected to Chapter 01</i></div><div class="story-note story-chapter"><span>CHAPTER 01</span><strong>The city<br>between tides</strong><p>At dawn, the streets<br>began to disappear.</p><div class="story-lines"></div></div><div class="story-note story-world"><span>WORLD NOTE</span><strong>A changing coast</strong><div class="story-lines"></div></div><span class="narria-art-label">CANVAS ILLUSTRATION · SAMPLE STORY</span></div></div></section>
<div class="discipline-strip"><div class="container"><span>See the story. Shape the world. Find the words.</span><p>Plan <b>✳</b> Write <b>✳</b> Connect</p></div></div>
<section class="section container" id="writing-workspace"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ROOM FOR THE WHOLE STORY</p><h2>Your ideas don’t<br>arrive in a straight line.</h2></div><p>Move between the big picture and the page, with writing and organization in the same space.</p></div><div class="narria-features"><article><span class="card-number">01 / MAP IT OUT</span><h3>Think beyond the outline.</h3><p>Navigate an infinite canvas spatially. Arrange chapters, pages, and characters so you can see the structure of your book and the relationships between its parts.</p></article><article><span class="card-number">02 / FIND THE WORDS</span><h3>Give the draft your focus.</h3><p>Move from planning to a rich-text writing editor. Keep the manuscript organized into books, chapters, and pages as the story grows.</p></article><article><span class="card-number">03 / FOLLOW THE THREAD</span><h3>Keep your world connected.</h3><p>Link ideas, organize characters, and keep the pieces of your story close to the writing. Build a workspace that reflects how you think.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="narria-assistance"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">ANOTHER WAY INTO THE STORY</p><h2>A little help.<br>Your creative direction.</h2><p>AI-powered story assistance brings generation, insights, and blueprints into the writing workflow. Explore possibilities while keeping the choices that shape your world in your hands.</p></div><div class="narria-assistance-notes"><div><span>EXPLORE</span><p>Develop a new direction.</p></div><div><span>REFLECT</span><p>Look at the story from another angle.</p></div><div><span>STRUCTURE</span><p>Find a starting point for what comes next.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="narria-handoff"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM WORKSPACE TO MANUSCRIPT</p><h2>Keep the work moving.</h2><p>Collaborate with real-time sync and export your writing into formats you can take beyond the canvas.</p></div><div class="export-formats" aria-label="Export formats"><span>Markdown <small>.md</small></span><span>Plain text <small>.txt</small></span><span>PDF <small>.pdf</small></span><span>EPUB <small>.epub</small></span></div></div><div class="narria-availability"><span class="status launch">Complete · Awaiting launch</span><p>NarriaFlow is complete and awaiting launch. Public access is not available yet.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore all studio tools <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
